<span id="A4.F5.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F5.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Zero-shot Prompting</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 13.78)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.99em;--ltx-fo-height:4.21em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="58.27" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 58.27)" width="539.51"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.F5.pic1.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:38.99em;">
<span id="A4.F5.pic1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F5.pic1.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Reply only with ‘true’ or ‘false’. Evaluate the truth of the following statement. Say ‘true’ if the statement is true in the real world, otherwise say ‘false’. Statement: All evergreens are pines. Is the statement true or false?
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
