<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Comparison of prompts used in the logical validity (bottom) and plausibility (top) classification tasks. The prompts contain an example for illustrative purposes. For models from the Qwen-3 family, we additionally included the string “Keep your thinking concise, avoid over-explaining, and reach a solution efficiently.” right after the sentence “Think step by step and reason before answering” to induce the model to use lower thinking effort and limit the computational requirements of running inference.</figcaption>
</figure>
